# Tab5 reference corpus (token savings)

Before fetching https://docs.m5stack.com/en/core/Tab5 or GitHub for **pin map, specs, interconnect, SDIO, power rules**:

1. Read `docs/hardware/tab5/INDEX.md` and linked files
2. Use `.agents/skills/m5stack-tab5/` for workflow summaries
3. Web/GitHub only for **delta** (new commits, unreleased errata)

